            "cta_label": "READ FULL REVIEWS",
            "cta_url": "/pages/reviews",
            "question_1": "What are electrolytes and why do they matter?",
            "answer_1": "<p>Electrolytes are essential minerals \u2014 sodium, potassium, magnesium \u2014 that regulate fluid balance, muscle function, and nerve signaling. Fortified delivers them at the doses your body actually needs.</p>",
            "question_2": "Why is Fortified different from other hydration drinks?",
            "answer_2": "<p>Most hydration drinks underdose sodium and skip key minerals like magnesium glycinate. Fortified is clinically dosed, zero sugar, and made with clean ingredients.</p>",
            "question_3": "What is the recommended dosage?",
            "answer_3": "<p>1 stick in 12\u201316oz of water, once a day. Active days or hot conditions? Take a second stick.</p>",
            "question_4": "Who should take Fortified?",
            "answer_4": "<p>Anyone training hard, working long hours, traveling, or just trying to stay properly hydrated \u2014 Fortified is formulated for daily use.</p>",
            "question_5": "Is Fortified safe for daily use?",
            "answer_5": "<p>Yes. The formula is built around clinically researched mineral doses and contains no artificial sweeteners, dyes, or stimulants.</p>",
            "question_6": "How fast will I feel the difference?",
            "answer_6": "<p>Most customers notice better hydration and energy within the first few servings \u2014 and report improved performance and recovery within a week.</p>"
          },
